[node name="GridBack" type="Panel" parent="Safe/PickPane"]
unique_name_in_owner = true
editor_description = "[필수] 지우면 오류 — TeamDraftView.gd _fit_grid_to_bottom()
Backplate 8px around the grid — keeps a short / filtered list from reading as 'the screen ended'. Runs past the screen bottom (code adds the bottom inset) so the bottom capsules float over it, no strip of screen background behind them."
